      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature1.body", "rect": [120, 336, 940, 170], "style": "Slide Body", "sample": "A typical order arrives in four containers that are used once, for twenty minutes. Most cannot be recycled because they are greasy, mixed material or too small to sort."},
