      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature2.body", "rect": [120, 256, 1200, 130], "style": "Slide Body", "sample": "Restaurants pack food in Vessly containers at no extra cost. Diners hand them back to the next courier, and we wash and return them within 48 hours."},
